Previous: <a href="Kanaly.html" accesskey="p" rel="prev">Каналы</a>, Up: <a href="Nastroika.html" accesskey="u" rel="up">Настройка</a> &nbsp; [<a href="index.html#SEC_Contents" title="Table of contents" rel="contents">Contents</a>][<a href="Terminy-i-ukazateli.html" title="Index" rel="index">Index</a>]</p>
